{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras/Quantum_Curse_Banner_01.png?t=1745298300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken as a prototype failsafe experiment unbeknownst as to its origin.\u00a0 Tasked with purging the corruption that has befallen the highly advanced civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imbued with access to super computers and quantum state manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape a mysterious abandoned laboratory.  <br>Manipulate, entangled quantum experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, shoot, explore, solve puzzles, backtrack and collect power ups.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your movement capabilities and traverse your surroundings with smooth, satisfying control and melt into the immersive sound design and track loops.<br><br>Human made sound design tailored specifically for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 10 themed laboratory regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find mobility enhancements, blaster power-ups and key items to allow access to previously inaccessible areas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot to kill a multitude of mutant threats and abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge traps and maneuver through various hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek to find 50 quantum computer access ports.\u00a0 Enter the quantum environment to manipulate blocks and particles tied to you own movements, destroy the particle experiments and disable each of the 50 quantum ports.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3242500?t=1745298300","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745298300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/2301c877ce3e9d9044a4be0a71f97ca493967e32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745298300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/2301c877ce3e9d9044a4be0a71f97ca493967e32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745298300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras/Quantum_Curse_Banner_01.png?t=1745298300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken as a prototype failsafe experiment unbeknownst as to its origin.\u00a0 Tasked with purging the corruption that has befallen the highly advanced civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imbued with access to super computers and quantum state manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape a mysterious abandoned laboratory.  <br>Manipulate, entangled quantum experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, shoot, explore, solve puzzles, backtrack and collect power ups.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your movement capabilities and traverse your surroundings with smooth, satisfying control and melt into the immersive sound design and track loops.<br><br>Human made sound design tailored specifically for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 10 themed laboratory regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find mobility enhancements, blaster power-ups and key items to allow access to previously inaccessible areas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot to kill a multitude of mutant threats and abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge traps and maneuver through various hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek to find 50 quantum computer access ports.\u00a0 Enter the quantum environment to manipulate blocks and particles tied to you own movements, destroy the particle experiments and disable each of the 50 quantum ports.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["James H. Van der Meulen"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/header.jpg?t=1745298300","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game was made with the intellectual property and creative assets created and owned by Artist, James H. Van der Meulen.<br />\r\nCopyright regarding the Art, Characters, World and Story of this Game belongs to James H. Van der Meulen.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257088446,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088446/movie480.mp4?t=1740765537","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088446/movie_max.mp4?t=1740765537"},"name":"Quantum Curse Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088446/83b15355f5d0825dd322068c2cd36c7504b83b53/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740765537","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088446/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740765537","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088446/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740765537"}}],"name":"Quantum Curse","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 360 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Trash Vomit Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"